From 93d6f99f1606431c62a4c44f5ac4e14c626d8793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:35:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] ci: run the full suite and the SSA regression corpus with
 debug-assertions ON

F5 fix (PR #637 audit): [profile.fastbuild] inherits release, so CI's
'cargo test --profile fastbuild' compiled every debug_assert! out -
including the %rax shadow-epoch validator and the GVN span-lockstep
check. The enforcement patch shipped into a pipeline that compiled the
enforcement away; the loud-failure story required someone to remember
'-C debug-assertions' locally (exactly how the GVN drained-Vec bug was
found, and exactly the discipline relic this machinery exists to
eliminate).

