a07d2ce8: assertions-ON corpus 797/797; after deleting that single
invalidate_acc, the corpus fails 796+1 with 'panicked at
src/backend/state.rs: x86 codegen: acc cache claims value 242 is
resident in %rax, but the %rax shadow epoch moved since the park
(117 -> 118): some emitter wrote %rax without invalidate_acc ... Last
unclassified emitted line: None'.
